  "card": "This pull request backports CI optimizations to the 30.x branch, inlining runner selection expressions and updating Docker layer caching to use GitHub Actions and WarpBuild cache proxies. The 30.x CI previously relied on the sunsetting Cirrus cache, experienced up to 15-minute Docker image pull delays, and suffered job scheduling delays behind a standalone runner-selection step. Commit notes cite common 1MB/s download rates and runner backlogs as motivation for the upstream changes. There are no dependencies.",
